-   $$ b_1 = 3\sqrt{\lambda_1} e_1, \quad b_2 = 3\sqrt{\lambda_2} e_2 $$
-   The bounding box is the axis-aligned box enclosing the parallelogram spanned by $b_1$ and $b_2$ centered at $\mu_{2D}$ [S1, unofficial].
