+1.  **Reconstruct 3D Covariance:** If not already provided, compute $\Sigma_w$ from quaternion $q$ and scale $s$.
+    $$ R = \text{QuaternionToMatrix}(q) $$
+    $$ S = \text{diag}(\exp(s_0), \exp(s_1), \exp(s_2)) $$
+    $$ \Sigma_w = R S S^\top R^\top $$
+    [S1, S7, unofficial]
